blocks.en:
Figure 5: Performance Analysis.
Top Left (a): Impact of compression ratio (%) on model performance for MILO and baseline methods;
Top Right (b): Impact of block size (number of examples per block) on latency and model accuracy for MILO.;
Bottom Left (c): Performance breakdown for MILO customized Triton kernels;
Bottom Right (d): Impact of rank allocation strategy on model accuracy for MILO.
All experiments are conducted using Qwen2.5-7B.

blocks.zh:
图5:业绩分析。
左上方(a):压缩率(%)对MILO模型性能和基准方法的影响;
右上方(b):块大小(每个块的例子数)对MILO的耐久性和模型精度的影响;
左下角(c):MILO定制的Triton内核的性能细分;
右下角(d):军衔分配战略对MILO模型准确性的影响.
所有实验均使用Quen2.5-7B进行.
